<title>USA: FDA clears Biomagnetic Magnes 2500WH.</title>
<headline>FDA clears Biomagnetic Magnes 2500WH.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Biomagnetic Technologies Inc said Monday it received formal clearance from the U.S. Food and Drug Administration to market the Magnes 2500WH System for clinical use in the U.S.</p>
<p>The system scans the magnetic fields in the brain to detect the nerve impulses that accompany bodily functions.</p>
<p>The company said there are 200 epilepsy care centers worldwide which could &quot;potentially&quot; benefit from use of the system.</p>
</text>
